    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduce</h2>Come and experience the joy of bullet screen games! <br>Become a zombie hunter! <br>This is an action pigeon type bullet screen shooting game. In a cartoonish forest, players face waves of zombies and try to survive by defeating them with their weapons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>Faced with a variety of zombies, players can shoot zombies with guns, blast them with grenades and oil barrels, and place walls to block zombies and bullets.<br>In wave after wave of dead tide, trying to survive, win the game.<br><br>Players can sprint to avoid zombies and bullets.<br><br>The picture of the game cartoon fresh, sound effect beautiful, all kinds of zombie charmingly naive.<br>The constant presence of zombie bosses adds to the playability.<br>Defeat the final BOSS and finish the game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multielement Weapon</h2>The player starts with a normal single-shot rifle, but automatically changes weapons when picking up other weapons.<br>There are machine guns, shotguns, fireball guns, laser guns, and the corresponding super machine guns, Super shotguns, super Fireball guns, super laser guns, and so on.<br><br>There are hidden weapons waiting to be discovered.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level Up</h2>Upgrade weapons with a variety of options, including bullet damage, shooting frequency, player movement speed, etc.<br><br>When one reaches its full level, a normal weapon evolves into a super weapon.",
